Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.78,0:00:11.41,Episode title 20,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,0)\pos(1548,582)}Spirit Club Hall
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.89,0:00:11.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spirit Club Hall?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.71,0:00:12.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know them?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.69,0:00:13.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've heard about them,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.95,0:00:15.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I didn't know there's one here.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.90,0:00:17.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't seek publicity.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.23,0:00:18.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without looking for it,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.76,0:00:20.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a club hall is normally unknown.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is your card.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And this is from Laozi.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.89,0:00:25.47,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.37,0:00:27.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It helps with recovery.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.85,0:00:28.52,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.85,0:00:30.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do I bring it back when I used it up?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.11,0:00:31.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not necessary.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.07,0:00:34.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can use it up to a considerable amount.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.34,0:00:36.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did Laozi tell you anything?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.03,0:00:38.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.67,0:00:40.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This card is also a pass to every club hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.08,0:00:43.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We offer services for all spirits who visit us.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.19,0:00:45.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For everyone?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.87,0:00:47.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You aren't aware of how club halls work today.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.09,0:00:49.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shall I expain it to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.71,0:00:50.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have time?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.70,0:00:52.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's part of my job.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.00,0:00:56.09,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Spirit Club Halls were founded by Laozi and two other deities.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.38,0:00:59.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's one in each large human city.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.20,0:01:00.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They offer services for spirits.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.23,0:01:03.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides acting as an inn, like in old times,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.29,0:01:06.49,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,it also provides financial support for living in the human world.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.65,0:01:07.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what's to do for it?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.93,0:01:08.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.88,0:01:11.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You only have to keep the rules of the hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.64,0:01:12.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are the rules?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.60,0:01:14.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't slay your own kind.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.37,0:01:17.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't reveal yourself in front of humans.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.80,0:01:19.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're willing to be summoned by us,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.87,0:01:21.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you can get even more benefits.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.31,0:01:52.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So are you gonna fight today, or not?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.62,0:01:58.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.67,0:02:00.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll keep my mouth shut!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.09,0:02:03.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is our practice field.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.59,0:02:05.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're the ones we just met.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.55,0:02:07.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are frequent visitors.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.50,0:02:09.88,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,They can't live in the city because of their appearance.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.06,0:02:11.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are they strong spirits?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.73,0:02:12.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.53,0:02:14.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then how come they can't take a human form?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.89,0:02:16.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All spirits have their genuine form.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.03,0:02:18.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not about cultivation.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.69,0:02:20.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A human form is good only for blending in.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.38,0:02:23.90,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Even those who can't transform can find an expert.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.41,0:02:26.53,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,They simply think it's below them to look human.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.80,0:02:27.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.49,0:02:30.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And who is the strongest among them and you?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.12,0:02:32.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must be the weakest here.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.94,0:02:34.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then how come you're the hall manager?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.08,0:02:36.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can make money.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.44,0:02:37.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you make money?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.10,0:02:40.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I sell these trees.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.66,0:02:43.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The lush vegetation here is your work, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.51,0:02:44.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.28,0:02:45.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.55,0:02:48.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trees born quickly from magic also die quickly.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.04,0:02:51.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the trees whose growth I stimulate,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.66,0:02:53.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are capable of surviving.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.40,0:02:54.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are trees that expensive?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.44,0:02:57.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good wood is extremely valuable.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.92,0:02:59.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Especially nowadays.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.46,0:03:01.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And moneymaking made you the boss?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.62,0:03:03.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.09,0:03:05.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go a floor up.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.41,0:03:07.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's one more floor?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.17,0:03:14.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stand still.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.55,0:03:27.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the core of the hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.47,0:03:29.89,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,You can see the location and data of every club hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.15,0:03:31.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's quite spectacular.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.84,0:03:35.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's better at places with bigger bandwidth.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.85,0:03:37.71,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Space fluctuations...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.12,0:03:39.00,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't just a map, is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.26,0:03:40.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's much more.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.46,0:03:42.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Every dot on the map represents a club hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.81,0:03:43.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beside being a sign,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.33,0:03:46.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,each dot actually connects us to a hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.98,0:03:49.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You say these are all space points?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.46,0:03:49.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.65,0:03:51.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.80,0:03:52.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is really awesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.50,0:03:55.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Qianzhen.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.77,0:03:56.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Manager!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.82,0:03:57.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Showing them around?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.34,0:03:58.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.19,0:04:00.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The others are waiting.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.45,0:04:01.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should hurry.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.33,0:04:03.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya later, little spirits!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.45,0:04:05.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some people have a meet-up here.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.59,0:04:08.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He doesn't hate humans?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.48,0:04:09.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He can't tell who's human.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.32,0:04:12.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyone can use this place?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.63,0:04:14.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.50,0:04:15.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't there troublemakers?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.93,0:04:17.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not for a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.78,0:04:20.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can see there our club hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.46,0:04:24.20,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,The color of the upper dot shows the profile of the hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.58,0:04:26.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ours is gold, as we do mainly commerce.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.70,0:04:29.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The dots below stand for the resident spirits.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.05,0:04:32.52,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,There's three of us here, including Tu Bei and me.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.88,0:04:35.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But also human assistants work in every hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.27,0:04:38.16,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,And how do they offer support\Nat halls which don't do commerce?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.37,0:04:40.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Resources are shared among halls.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.22,0:04:42.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like capital, space, military force,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,magic weapons and tools.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.31,0:04:47.85,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,The hall manager can use them within his authority.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.19,0:04:49.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there are people even here,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.88,0:04:52.62,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,why is it a rule that you can't reveal yourself to humans?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.21,0:04:55.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In fact, many people know about our existence.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.78,0:04:57.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like you, a confidant of Lord Xuanli.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.78,0:05:00.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But not every human can tolerate us.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.86,0:05:02.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was better back then,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.31,0:05:05.05,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,but since people got stronger, we've got troubles.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.09,0:05:08.99,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,After a few incidents, we established the current rules.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.50,0:05:11.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the best way now to get along.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.85,0:05:13.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.20,0:05:16.44,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to earn money in the first place?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.58,0:05:18.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't you just create gold or money?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.98,0:05:21.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would wreck up the human financial world.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.30,0:05:24.86,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,On the long run, it's best to do commerce following their rules.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.35,0:05:27.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means I should open an ice warehouse.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.40,0:05:28.00,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will steal.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.16,0:05:29.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not "making" money...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.11,0:05:31.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or you could do express deliveries.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.53,0:05:34.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.28,0:05:37.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was the introduction.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.88,0:05:40.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you like to hear some more details?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.73,0:05:41.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not for now.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.09,0:05:43.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let us have a cup of tea.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.51,0:05:44.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.28,0:05:56.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Won't you stay for lunch?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.02,0:05:58.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my grandfather is waiting for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.26,0:06:00.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today we can't.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.51,0:06:01.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.55,0:06:03.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.63,0:06:06.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.44,0:06:08.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Feel free to accept it.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.88,0:06:09.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's from Laozi.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.29,0:06:11.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you promise anime merch to him?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.91,0:06:12.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.21,0:06:15.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.55,0:06:28.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should I take you to Shan Xin's?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.33,0:06:28.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.98,0:06:30.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to an anime con tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.15,0:06:33.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go home and renovate the shrine.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.68,0:06:35.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.93,0:06:36.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.81,0:06:37.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.75,0:06:38.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shan Xin!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.11,0:06:40.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did you know I'm here?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.95,0:06:42.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was about to visit you.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.17,0:06:43.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.67,0:06:44.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Out there?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.56,0:06:45.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,'Sup, Gen.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.88,0:06:46.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you here...?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.97,0:06:48.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I came for Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.68,0:06:49.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Xiaohei, for Huang.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.51,0:06:51.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.16,0:06:53.04,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd rather go home...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.77,0:06:58.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.84,0:07:00.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Fu and co. have left.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.44,0:07:01.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They went to the city.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.71,0:07:03.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They know how to behave.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.82,0:07:06.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They might be following Lord Xuanli.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.30,0:07:11.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They know how to behave.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.64,0:07:22.39,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get off.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.74,0:07:25.60,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to be attacked on the bus.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.80,0:07:45.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.33,0:07:47.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's do some sparring.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.31,0:07:50.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.81,0:07:51.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Conflict means chance.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.62,0:07:53.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if they find us?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.11,0:07:55.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone's here.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.91,0:07:57.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.25,0:08:03.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.45,0:08:05.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we say we just passed here?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.27,0:08:06.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.52,0:08:08.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.33,0:08:10.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We came to help you!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.44,0:08:12.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He won't buy this...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.36,0:08:14.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.47,0:08:18.23,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(940,182)}Dongdong\NBobo\NMang Yan\NGen
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.47,0:08:18.23,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1376,184)}Kali\NMutou\NYunfei\NDa Shuang
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.73,0:08:21.77,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(62,68)}Service staff:\NTu Bei\NTu Yi
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.73,0:08:21.77,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(376,128)}Hu Niu\NKucha
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.73,0:08:21.77,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962,114)}Dandan\NFenmo
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.73,0:08:21.77,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1436,134)}Biti Chaogan ZC
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.77,0:08:25.28,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(54,82)}Gen, Xiaobai, Xiaohei:\NShan Xin
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.77,0:08:25.28,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(488,200)}Tu Bei:\NBaomu Zhongyang
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.77,0:08:25.28,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(924,66)}Kali:\NXiahou Luofeng\N\NQingqiu:\NTeng Xin\N\NFu:\NTutehameng
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.77,0:08:25.28,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(1114,498)}He still\Nhasn't spoken yet
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.77,0:08:25.28,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\fs48\fnAlegreya Sans Black\pos(1206,552)}↘
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.28,0:08:28.45,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(136,462)}Sound engineer:
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.28,0:08:28.45,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(678,482)}Piyu:\NTao Bao\N\NHeishu:\NAi Suo
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.28,0:08:28.45,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1548,422)}Sun Yujing\NSun Zhongyang\NWang Miao\NBohe
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.54,0:08:39.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're having fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.23,0:08:41.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(464,596)}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.97,0:09:10.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are equally strong.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.72,0:09:12.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Polao?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.98,0:09:15.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One is just brute force.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.49,0:09:17.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The other is weak and powerless.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.20,0:09:18.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who do you mean, you old geezer?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.89,0:09:19.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You and him.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.68,0:09:20.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up, silly old frog!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.53,0:09:22.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is bad...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.92,0:09:23.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.05,0:09:24.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Axian.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.53,0:09:26.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.22,0:09:31.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.22,0:09:33.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't cut me down...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.37,0:09:35.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He cut the space switch.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.87,0:09:38.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,'Return home'?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.10,0:09:40.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It launches slowly.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.10,0:09:41.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay alert.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.59,0:09:44.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there's no more business,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.00,0:09:44.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,may I leave now?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.56,0:09:48.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We came for the Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.32,0:09:50.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you willing to part with it?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.74,0:09:51.60,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.34,0:09:53.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.90,0:09:56.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The prizes of vow quests can be robbed.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.58,0:09:58.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose you knew about this.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.48,0:09:59.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.92,0:10:02.57,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,You say the Sky Pearl you have is not from Laozi?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.87,0:10:04.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have any Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.94,0:10:05.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.08,0:10:08.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.13,0:10:09.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.65,0:10:12.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He really doesn't have the Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.91,0:10:14.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So even you can be wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.34,0:10:17.08,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Then it must be at the girl or the cat, surprisingly.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.52,0:10:18.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was careless.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.04,0:10:20.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So may I leave now?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.35,0:10:22.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shall keep our company for a few days.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.57,0:10:23.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really get it wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.76,0:10:25.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can tell truth and lies apart.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.41,0:10:26.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's useless to try to deny.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.53,0:10:29.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to leave, you must defeat all of us.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.06,0:10:31.87,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Darn...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.53,0:10:34.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't bother you any longer...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.49,0:10:35.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't bother us.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.52,0:10:38.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to trouble you for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.95,0:10:45.37,Episode title 21,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,0)\pos(1344,508)}Mission: Sky Pearl
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.93,0:10:50.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.12,0:10:52.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go forward and throw a grenade!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.47,0:10:53.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.13,0:10:57.47,Text D7,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\pos(912,890)}Kitty Grenade
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.11,0:11:02.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.85,0:11:03.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:04.73,Text D7,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\pos(912,890)}Kitty Grenade
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.73,0:11:06.94,Text D7,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(904,896)}Milk
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.32,0:11:05.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.77,0:11:06.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.94,0:11:18.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.26,0:11:19.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.54,0:11:22.25,Text D7,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,200)\fs60\pos(378,284)}Settings
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.20,0:11:23.33,Text D7,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs60\pos(396,466)}Exit
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.99,0:11:25.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.10,0:11:28.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're awesome!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.73,0:11:30.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't this available only since yesterday?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.84,0:11:31.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.84,0:11:32.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a pro after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.13,0:11:35.90,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.01,0:11:51.81,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What does it say?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.88,0:11:53.34,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I eat it?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.78,0:12:10.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This spirit space is quite comfortable.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.57,0:12:12.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you worried?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.36,0:12:14.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would I be?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.51,0:12:15.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For your comrades.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.85,0:12:18.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense to worry.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.60,0:12:19.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.86,0:12:21.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But last time you beat us hard.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.32,0:12:23.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because you guys are weak.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.76,0:12:27.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.41,0:12:34.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is there a wall here?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.24,0:12:36.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Axian!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.86,0:12:38.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The space ends here!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.49,0:12:40.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.63,0:12:41.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It ends abruptly?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.62,0:12:42.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't help us.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.01,0:12:44.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't spirit spaces spherical?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.88,0:12:46.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only natural, complete spaces are.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.74,0:12:47.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.60,0:12:49.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since we're together in trouble now,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.63,0:12:52.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will you tell me now why you came here?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.55,0:12:57.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,'River Fu' Spirit Elixir.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.59,0:12:59.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The day after a stable state is reached,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.96,0:13:03.14,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,take one pill in the morning,\Nduring the day and at the evening,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.52,0:13:04.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and you are cured.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.13,0:13:06.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Postscript!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.12,0:13:08.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say hello to Wuxian for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.05,0:13:10.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is written here.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.67,0:13:11.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you talking to Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.65,0:13:14.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.60,0:13:16.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep on dreaming, girl...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.66,0:13:17.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei can understand me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.12,0:13:19.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Xiaohuang understands me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.56,0:13:20.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.83,0:13:21.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huang!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.80,0:13:33.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you so silly now?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.26,0:13:35.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And can he understand a lot?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.98,0:13:36.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.47,0:13:38.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be happy!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.77,0:13:39.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Smile!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.06,0:13:40.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say meow!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.68,0:13:42.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Convinced yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.91,0:13:44.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't see the difference.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.57,0:13:45.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.51,0:13:46.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be happy!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.08,0:13:47.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be scared!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.32,0:13:49.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Convinced yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.05,0:13:50.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm telling the truth.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.73,0:13:51.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.85,0:13:53.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not only he can understand me,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.31,0:13:54.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I can understand him too.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.44,0:13:56.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.73,0:13:57.44,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.81,0:13:58.95,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can tell her that we can communicate,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.95,0:13:59.60,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but don't talk about spirits.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.60,0:14:00.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.57,0:14:01.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if it's true...?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.04,0:14:03.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need to test it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.51,0:14:07.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to an anime con tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.77,0:14:09.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai is the cutest.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.39,0:14:12.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, don't flatter me!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.97,0:14:13.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.91,0:14:15.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One more test!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.27,0:14:24.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You took Xiaohei to the bathroom,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.81,0:14:26.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but just stared at him and didn't say a word.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.59,0:14:29.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Believe it now?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.68,0:14:30.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.04,0:14:32.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei also understands Piyu.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.13,0:14:34.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He can translate for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.61,0:14:35.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.66,0:14:37.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huang, you're useless.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.60,0:14:42.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei says Xiaohuang says he's hungry.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.18,0:14:44.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You little glutton...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.39,0:14:46.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dinner's ready!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.68,0:14:49.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it, you're awesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.11,0:14:51.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dinner's ready!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.27,0:14:52.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.32,0:14:56.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Musi, Axian and Tanjiu.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.02,0:14:59.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you three came for the Sky Pearl too?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.42,0:15:01.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you mad at us, Lord Xuanli?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.22,0:15:02.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.24,0:15:04.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This might be your lucky day.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.25,0:15:06.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need it for cultivation?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.93,0:15:07.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.69,0:15:09.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spirit force is scarce today.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.27,0:15:10.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cultivation got much harder.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.98,0:15:13.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry we left you alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.90,0:15:14.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you found it?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.11,0:15:16.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the time being, no.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.63,0:15:18.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's hard to trace those riding a vehicle.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.20,0:15:22.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said earlier that if we can find it,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.34,0:15:23.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you give it to us, am I right?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.15,0:15:24.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.02,0:15:26.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got no chance against you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.43,0:15:28.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I want them to be safe.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.91,0:15:29.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We appreciate it.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.00,0:15:32.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can a robbery be that civilized?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.90,0:15:34.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are all well-mannered.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.94,0:15:35.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just now...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.92,0:15:38.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I've heard you call him Xuanli.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.47,0:15:39.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it a problem?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.50,0:15:41.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.60,0:15:43.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he is not Xuanli.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.10,0:15:49.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never said I was him.
