Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.09,0:16:42.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.22,0:16:44.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So many people!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.78,0:16:45.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.81,0:16:47.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the biggest anime convention in town.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.46,0:16:50.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't know Xiaohei was interested in this.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.85,0:16:51.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's rare for a cat.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.02,0:16:52.99,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to stay there...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.13,0:16:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(464,596)}
