Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:23.19,Staff3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(472,600)}Why are we all crammed here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:23.19,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(506,256)}Musi, Axian, Tanjiu:\NDing Dang
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:23.19,Staff3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(916,602)}Bear with it, there's\Na wedding over there
