Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:29.40,Episode title 22,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1264,664)}Anime Convention
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.94,0:18:08.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've sensed them.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.43,0:18:14.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This one, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.38,0:18:15.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your purchase!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.73,0:18:16.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you buy?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.95,0:18:17.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a small gift.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.35,0:18:19.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.37,0:18:22.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Handsome guy.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.96,0:18:23.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.09,0:19:00.99,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,"Gate of the Living" is now available at Sector B3.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.27,0:19:03.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An ID is required to make a purchase.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.56,0:19:05.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not use another person's name.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.38,0:19:06.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go stand in line.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.69,0:19:07.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You go have fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.97,0:19:08.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.01,0:19:10.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't buy that.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.04,0:19:11.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll meet when I'm done.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.26,0:19:13.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to go alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.66,0:19:14.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Dad's here.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.59,0:19:16.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mr. Shan!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.84,0:19:17.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going now.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.91,0:19:18.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll call you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.95,0:19:19.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.57,0:19:21.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Feeling better, kitten?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.96,0:19:22.69,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Much better.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.69,0:19:23.67,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you come back to the tower last time?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.22,0:19:26.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave the past alone...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.88,0:19:28.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the topic?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.74,0:19:29.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,World politics.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.02,0:19:31.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.68,0:19:32.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shopping for Master Lao.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.86,0:19:33.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to do that too.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.33,0:19:36.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence that we meet here!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.86,0:19:38.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've heard your voice, so I came here.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.74,0:19:39.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.21,0:19:41.04,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You come here often?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.08,0:19:41.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.07,0:19:43.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can be myself here.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.43,0:19:44.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You like conventions?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.80,0:19:46.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, can we make some pictures with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.99,0:19:47.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.36,0:19:50.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.26,0:19:50.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.61,0:19:52.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who does he cosplay?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.69,0:19:53.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No idea, but he's so cute!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.06,0:19:54.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oho...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.19,0:19:56.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're yourself, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.11,0:19:57.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.65,0:20:00.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have to disguise myself here.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.51,0:20:06.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it was Tanjiu who created your copies.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.89,0:20:09.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only your spirit parts are here right now?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.69,0:20:10.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.66,0:20:12.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our real bodies are in a safe place.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.86,0:20:15.54,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,We won't get hurt even if our copies are destroyed.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.86,0:20:18.66,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Of course, if we don't get them back,\Nwe lose cultivation.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.31,0:20:20.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Judging by your appearance,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.59,0:20:22.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I assume you live among humans, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.84,0:20:23.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.90,0:20:25.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We even have jobs.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.33,0:20:25.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.94,0:20:26.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.74,0:20:28.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,comic book artists!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.87,0:20:28.00,Text H,,0,0,0,,{\pos(994,78)}Comic book\Nartists
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.16,0:20:28.00,Text H2,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\an7\pos(1606,934)}They're late\Nwith manuscripts\Non cultivation days
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.20,0:20:28.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.07,0:20:31.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never met a spirit who has such a job.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.51,0:20:34.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you are in fact not Lord Xuanli?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.47,0:20:35.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.39,0:20:36.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May I ask your family name?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.02,0:20:37.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Luo.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.89,0:20:38.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wolverine?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.97,0:20:39.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.16,0:20:40.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.64,0:20:44.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will we stay here forever?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.77,0:20:45.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.85,0:20:47.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose you'd rather leave too.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.85,0:20:48.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you have a plan.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.41,0:20:50.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we join forces,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.73,0:20:51.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we can't defeat them,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.09,0:20:53.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but it's easy to escape.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.89,0:20:55.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These here?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.83,0:20:56.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.75,0:20:57.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will he like them?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.87,0:20:58.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.62,0:21:01.74,Text H,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.82,0:21:00.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd like these two, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.54,0:21:01.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.43,0:21:03.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.80,0:21:05.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you take this to Laozi?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.18,0:21:08.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bought it for him?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.56,0:21:09.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.82,0:21:11.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take it yourself?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.46,0:21:12.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.59,0:21:16.14,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,But Gen said the Blue Jade Disc can be used only once in a month.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.32,0:21:17.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take it to him.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.92,0:21:19.01,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it Laozi's personal magic tool?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.36,0:21:20.76,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come it can't be used more often?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.89,0:21:23.96,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,The Disc is a first-rate magic tool for fixed-point teleportation.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.16,0:21:26.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose the limit was set especially for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.44,0:21:28.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.51,0:21:30.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He doesn't want me to visit more often?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.60,0:21:31.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot tell.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.87,0:21:33.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should ask him next time.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.86,0:21:34.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.23,0:21:36.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your badges are packed.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.58,0:21:42.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.85,0:21:43.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.03,0:21:45.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's quite crowded...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.40,0:21:46.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.44,0:21:49.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what now?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.12,0:21:50.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait until they come out?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.89,0:21:56.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you found it?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.88,0:21:57.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.98,0:21:59.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's time you kept your promise.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.15,0:22:02.81,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's strange you can't see those three?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.50,0:22:04.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you say that?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.72,0:22:06.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So your closed eyes are just a facade.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.69,0:22:08.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought you rely on spirit sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.70,0:22:10.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haven't you noticed they already left?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.82,0:22:13.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,None of you can leave this spirit space.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.42,0:22:14.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.79,0:22:16.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,None of you are space type.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.39,0:22:18.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you know we can't leave?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.86,0:22:20.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Qiuxian.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.68,0:22:31.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay here and watch.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.11,0:22:33.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I call Polao in.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.96,0:22:36.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what are all these humans doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.91,0:22:38.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's market day.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.15,0:22:39.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Polao.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.17,0:22:41.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please come in for a minute.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.24,0:22:46.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.72,0:22:50.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are not here.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.07,0:22:51.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.06,0:22:53.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They don't have such abilities.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.94,0:22:56.30,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, why would they have stayed for so long?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.58,0:23:03.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are going to look for the Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.73,0:23:04.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.24,0:23:32.62,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette\NStay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.62,0:23:37.36,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo \NOur destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.36,0:23:42.06,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni\NBut with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.06,0:23:48.26,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to\NI’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.26,0:23:54.41,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete\NWait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.41,0:23:59.21,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo\NEven if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.21,0:24:03.89,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara\NWhen we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.89,0:24:10.41,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou\NLet’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.41,0:24:21.73,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga\NThe days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.73,0:24:27.15,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite\NAre so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.15,0:24:32.19,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai\NThose feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.19,0:24:43.42,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo\NWe can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.42,0:24:48.97,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu\NBut they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.97,0:24:55.81,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu\N And surely, they’re calling out to me
